WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:39.490
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.760 --> 01:40.280
You…

3
01:41.520 --> 01:42.800
…killed my father.

4
01:46.320 --> 01:47.240
You…

5
01:47.600 --> 01:48.880
…are not my friend.

6
01:49.480 --> 01:50.720
You are not my friend either.

7
03:56.640 --> 03:59.840
(The parliament is reaching the end of its term.)

8
04:00.600 --> 04:04.320
(The government is preparing to hold a general election in the next three months.)

9
04:05.120 --> 04:09.560
(The election will be held on the 25th Buddhist Century Anniversary.)

10
04:10.360 --> 04:16.960
(The prime minister pledges to hold a fair and transparent election)

11
04:17.240 --> 04:19.440
(to celebrate the special occasion.)

12
04:27.600 --> 04:28.080
Stop.

13
04:28.080 --> 04:28.720
Hey, stop.

14
04:29.400 --> 04:30.280
What’s going on?

15
04:32.920 --> 04:33.680
You want to try me.

16
04:33.800 --> 04:34.160
Come on.

17
04:34.760 --> 04:35.360
Bring it on.

18
04:37.200 --> 04:38.320
Please don’t hurt me.

19
04:56.080 --> 04:57.320
Hey! Stop it.

20
05:07.520 --> 05:09.080
I don’t know what the hell is going on between you guys.

21
05:10.400 --> 05:13.120
But you are a real loser for beating up the kid.

22
05:14.240 --> 05:14.920
Who the hell are you?

23
05:15.520 --> 05:16.280
This is none of your f*cking business.

24
05:21.000 --> 05:21.960
I’m your daddy.

25
05:25.000 --> 05:25.920
Kiddo.

26
05:26.360 --> 05:27.720
You can go now.

27
06:04.440 --> 06:05.560
Great!

28
06:06.760 --> 06:07.560
Amazing.

29
06:08.400 --> 06:08.960
Awesome.

30
06:11.640 --> 06:13.240
How dare you beat up a boy!

31
06:13.960 --> 06:15.040
Your parents send you to school,

32
06:15.200 --> 06:16.360
but you don’t study.

33
06:16.840 --> 06:18.760
Don’t ever dare to beat up a kid again.

34
06:19.400 --> 06:20.080
I won’t do it.

35
06:20.400 --> 06:22.000
Now, you can talk to me politely?

36
06:22.320 --> 06:23.080
Hey!

37
06:29.480 --> 06:30.480
What the hell did you do to my bro?

38
06:35.840 --> 06:37.040
Now, I get to have a bit more fun.

39
06:53.800 --> 06:54.320
Get up.

40
06:55.160 --> 06:56.040
Kick his ass.

41
07:19.080 --> 07:21.240
Get him. What the f*ck are you waiting for?

42
07:43.000 --> 07:44.200
I haven’t come to Thonburi for a while.

43
07:44.440 --> 07:45.560
I almost don’t remember it.

44
08:03.520 --> 08:05.680
These punks are fighting again.

45
08:06.280 --> 08:07.680
All they do is cause trouble.

46
08:10.400 --> 08:10.960
Don’t be scared, honey.

47
08:12.960 --> 08:14.000
They fight every day.

48
08:17.040 --> 08:17.600
Shit!

49
08:24.160 --> 08:24.600
Hey.

50
09:11.400 --> 09:11.800
Come on.

51
09:12.360 --> 09:12.840
Hurry up.

52
09:25.760 --> 09:26.480
Faster.

53
09:49.640 --> 09:50.080
Be careful.

54
10:03.000 --> 10:03.440
Thanks.

55
10:34.400 --> 10:34.760
Hey.

56
10:36.240 --> 10:36.800
Where are you going?

57
10:41.080 --> 10:41.480
Hey.

58
10:42.360 --> 10:43.120
Where are you going?

59
10:46.760 --> 10:47.240
What’s wrong?

60
10:48.520 --> 10:49.480
You don’t want to talk to me?

61
10:50.720 --> 10:51.280
You don’t like me?

62
11:05.760 --> 11:06.280
Are you afraid of me?

63
11:07.200 --> 11:08.000
No, I’m not.

64
11:09.600 --> 11:11.160
I just don’t want to talk to a gangster.

65
11:14.280 --> 11:15.560
You don’t like me. Then why did you help me?

66
11:17.400 --> 11:18.560
I saw you run after the bus.

67
11:19.320 --> 11:20.320
I’m worried that you might die.

68
11:24.800 --> 11:25.440
How does my hair look?

69
11:34.800 --> 11:35.400
You look good.

70
11:46.120 --> 11:47.040
Are you from around here?

71
11:48.760 --> 11:49.920
You came from Phra Nakorn, didn’t you?

72
11:52.680 --> 11:53.520
Are you here for work?

73
11:56.000 --> 11:57.920
You must come to see your wife, right?

74
12:03.080 --> 12:04.080
The area is rough.

75
12:04.840 --> 12:05.640
Do you want my help?

76
12:06.120 --> 12:07.560
This is to repay you for helping me earlier.

77
12:11.560 --> 12:12.520
You should worry about yourself.

78
12:13.480 --> 12:14.400
You almost got beaten up.

79
12:24.080 --> 12:24.720
I’m getting off here.

80
12:31.320 --> 12:31.600
Here.

81
12:33.320 --> 12:34.440
Pay the bus fare for me.

82
12:34.920 --> 12:35.320
No.

83
12:37.240 --> 12:39.520
Keep it. I don’t like owing people.

84
12:44.960 --> 12:45.920
Thanks for helping me earlier.

85
12:56.040 --> 12:56.600
Is he crazy?

86
13:00.880 --> 13:01.920
THONBURI GANGSTER

87
13:02.840 --> 13:03.360
Hey!

88
13:06.640 --> 13:07.680
Now you want to know me.

89
13:10.840 --> 13:11.480
Is this your comb?

90
13:16.640 --> 13:17.200
Keep it.

91
13:18.440 --> 13:18.840
Hey.

92
13:20.040 --> 13:20.520
Damn it.

93
13:23.440 --> 13:35.600
THONBURI PROVINCIAL PRISON

94
14:11.440 --> 14:15.640
URGENT SALE

95
14:18.200 --> 14:20.080
This house has been vacant for a while.

96
14:20.440 --> 14:21.560
Their son is in prison.

97
14:22.400 --> 14:24.200
They were embarrassed. So they moved away.

98
14:25.320 --> 14:26.640
Zoe, is that you?

99
14:27.520 --> 14:28.200
Hello, auntie.

100
14:28.840 --> 14:30.640
Excuse me. I need to go home.

101
14:57.240 --> 14:58.640
KRADAT BEAUTY SALON

102
14:58.640 --> 15:00.400
Your curls look amazing.

103
15:01.560 --> 15:02.480
Let me fix this part a bit.

104
15:06.040 --> 15:07.960
Next time, you should get a root perm.

105
15:08.160 --> 15:09.560
I guarantee you will look modish.

106
15:10.160 --> 15:12.080
My hair looks great. I love it.

107
15:12.800 --> 15:13.200
I’m leaving.

108
15:13.480 --> 15:14.480
Watch your step.

109
15:14.560 --> 15:14.880
Yes.

110
15:24.120 --> 15:24.720
Yong.

111
15:28.800 --> 15:29.600
How have you been?

112
15:29.880 --> 15:30.640
What are you doing here?

113
15:31.960 --> 15:34.720
I came to the address on the postcard you sent me.

114
15:36.080 --> 15:38.480
It looks so old. I can’t believe you still keep it.

115
15:41.680 --> 15:43.800
I have a gift for you.

116
15:45.520 --> 15:46.080
What is it?

117
15:46.720 --> 15:47.600
You will like them.

118
15:53.320 --> 15:54.640
They are so cute.

119
15:55.760 --> 15:56.360
I’ll use them now.

120
16:04.160 --> 16:04.520
One more.

121
16:08.520 --> 16:09.080
How do I look?

122
16:09.600 --> 16:10.440
Groovy.

123
16:13.160 --> 16:14.600
What are you doing in Thonburi?

124
16:18.400 --> 16:19.520
I…

125
16:24.840 --> 16:25.640
This is my mom.

126
16:27.760 --> 16:29.600
I heard that she moved to Thonburi.

127
16:30.720 --> 16:32.280
Have you ever seen her?

128
16:45.840 --> 16:46.840
Chayasilpa.

129
16:55.920 --> 16:56.680
Here it is.

130
16:56.680 --> 16:57.480
CHAYASILPA

131
16:57.520 --> 16:58.800
Let’s ask the owner.

132
17:01.040 --> 17:01.680
Hello.

133
17:02.440 --> 17:03.360
I’m Kradat.

134
17:04.360 --> 17:05.360
What’s up, Kradat?

135
17:06.200 --> 17:07.480
Do you know the woman in the picture?

136
17:13.160 --> 17:13.680
Hey.

137
17:14.960 --> 17:15.440
Hey.

138
17:40.360 --> 17:41.120
It’s him.

139
17:55.160 --> 17:56.120
Is your wife living here?

140
17:58.800 --> 18:00.160
I came to see the owner.

141
18:03.240 --> 18:03.760
Where is he?

142
18:07.640 --> 18:09.400
You came to harass him, didn’t you?

143
18:10.120 --> 18:12.200
That’s why he quickly ran away.

144
18:14.080 --> 18:15.360
You must really dislike gangsters.

145
18:20.920 --> 18:23.240
I came to pick up the picture that you are admiring.

146
18:34.880 --> 18:35.640
So full of yourself.

147
18:45.800 --> 18:46.560
Wait.

148
18:49.840 --> 18:50.320
Here.

149
18:51.440 --> 18:52.720
You dropped it on the bus.

150
18:53.760 --> 18:54.360
Take it.

151
18:56.720 --> 18:57.800
I have several combs.

152
18:59.480 --> 19:00.360
I think you need it.

153
19:04.880 --> 19:08.040
If you want to have a wife, you need to put yourself together.

154
19:10.280 --> 19:10.800
Take it back.

155
19:18.920 --> 19:20.080
Hey, what are you doing?

156
19:20.520 --> 19:21.120
What the heck?

157
19:21.320 --> 19:21.760
Stay still.

158
19:38.840 --> 19:42.360
Your outfit is not bad, but your hair is a mess.

159
19:42.880 --> 19:44.800
Put oil on your hair. Girls like it.

160
19:53.920 --> 19:54.560
Hey.

161
19:55.800 --> 19:56.840
My hair is none of your business.

162
19:57.440 --> 19:59.360
I help you look decent. Why are you against it?

163
19:59.520 --> 20:00.600
I look decent.

164
20:01.360 --> 20:02.360
I’m also a decent person.

165
20:03.400 --> 20:04.280
What about you?

166
20:14.440 --> 20:14.960
What’s your name?

167
20:18.840 --> 20:20.640
Yong. My name is Yong.

168
20:21.520 --> 20:21.880
Yong.

169
20:23.320 --> 20:24.000
I’ll remember it.

170
20:29.000 --> 20:30.000
I won’t tell you my name.

171
20:30.520 --> 20:31.960
If you want to know, you can ask around.

172
20:41.160 --> 20:42.560
What the hell is wrong with him?

173
20:46.880 --> 20:47.600
I didn’t say anything.

174
21:00.800 --> 21:01.320
Come and help me.

175
21:01.320 --> 21:03.120
KLOOKFOON GANG, PHRA NAKORN PROVINCE

176
21:03.120 --> 21:05.640
Are there three bottles of booze in the box?

177
21:06.960 --> 21:07.680
Yes, they are all here.

178
21:08.760 --> 21:09.160
Okay.

179
21:09.800 --> 21:11.320
Din, the fuzz is here.

180
21:11.760 --> 21:12.480
Hello, officer.

181
21:13.160 --> 21:13.960
What’s up?

182
21:15.200 --> 21:16.040
Can I search your warehouse?

183
21:16.600 --> 21:17.000
Go.

184
21:17.480 --> 21:18.160
You, search there.

185
21:19.280 --> 21:20.320
Let them search.

186
21:40.840 --> 21:41.840
These goods are smuggled in.

187
21:42.320 --> 21:43.360
They don’t match the records.

188
21:44.440 --> 21:45.960
Seize these goods.

189
21:46.240 --> 21:47.760
You can’t take them.

190
21:48.080 --> 21:49.960
Officer, can’t you wait until Zeng gets here?

191
21:51.960 --> 21:52.840
Why do I need to wait for him?

192
21:54.360 --> 21:55.320
Put it back.

193
21:55.480 --> 21:56.760
Calm down.

194
21:58.720 --> 21:59.400
Put it down.

195
21:59.760 --> 22:00.520
Calm down.

196
22:34.720 --> 22:35.320
Put it back.

197
22:35.360 --> 22:36.040
Move.

198
22:36.200 --> 22:36.720
Din.

199
22:48.280 --> 22:49.080
Can we talk over there?

200
22:57.120 --> 22:58.680
The goods just came in yesterday.

201
22:59.760 --> 23:02.160
My boys haven’t had time to check them.

202
23:05.560 --> 23:06.560
Can you let it slide for once?

203
23:11.240 --> 23:12.400
Din and Kheow are released on bail.

204
23:12.560 --> 23:15.280
Bail paper for Hoi will be ready tomorrow.

205
23:15.680 --> 23:17.280
So he will spend tonight in jail.

206
23:21.480 --> 23:24.960
Five-O is a bit strict with sin goods these days.

207
23:25.840 --> 23:26.800
We need to be more careful.

208
23:27.240 --> 23:27.760
Yes, boss.

209
23:31.440 --> 23:32.440
You never abandon your men.

210
23:35.920 --> 23:38.480
You are exactly like your father, Suea Yai.

211
23:40.160 --> 23:41.240
That’s why I like you.

212
23:43.240 --> 23:46.400
Without your dad and you, the dock and the warehouse business

213
23:47.840 --> 23:49.640
wouldn’t have grown this big.

214
23:52.480 --> 23:54.240
From now on, the dock will be packed with ships every day.

215
23:57.080 --> 23:59.120
I just work hard to repay your kindness.

216
24:01.160 --> 24:05.320
Boss, about the warehouse…

217
24:07.240 --> 24:07.680
Right.

218
24:09.000 --> 24:09.760
Don’t worry.

219
24:13.280 --> 24:15.400
I owed your father a lot.

220
24:17.280 --> 24:20.520
The promise I gave to your dad, I will never forget it.

221
24:23.440 --> 24:25.040
Three months from now, after the election.

222
24:27.120 --> 24:29.400
I will transfer the warehouse ownership to you.

223
24:30.680 --> 24:31.440
After the election?

224
24:35.080 --> 24:35.840
Really?

225
24:37.520 --> 24:38.320
Yes.

226
24:39.560 --> 24:40.400
You don’t need to worry.

227
24:42.760 --> 24:43.840
I’m not worried, boss.

228
24:46.320 --> 24:47.280
I didn’t expect it.

229
24:47.560 --> 24:48.560
If you’d be so kind,

230
24:50.160 --> 24:51.240
I’d be happy to accept it.

231
24:52.920 --> 24:53.560
Goodbye.

232
24:54.560 --> 24:55.120
Bye.

233
24:59.080 --> 24:59.800
Damn.

234
25:04.640 --> 25:05.280
Hey, Zeng.

235
25:34.600 --> 25:35.200
Guys.

236
25:40.200 --> 25:41.880
Three months from now.

237
25:43.360 --> 25:44.240
After the election.

238
25:44.880 --> 25:45.560
This place,

239
25:46.840 --> 25:47.920
it will be ours.

240
25:50.280 --> 25:52.320
You guys will have a salary.

241
25:52.760 --> 25:54.160
You will no longer need to collect debts for others.

242
25:54.440 --> 25:57.360
The villagers hate us to the guts already.

243
25:58.640 --> 25:59.320
Do you mean it?

244
25:59.560 --> 26:00.160
Yes.

245
26:02.080 --> 26:02.680
Today,

246
26:04.600 --> 26:06.360
I don’t take the money from work.

247
26:07.080 --> 26:07.560
Din.

248
26:08.680 --> 26:09.760
Take the money and give it to everyone.

249
26:10.920 --> 26:12.520
Buy food and drinks and celebrate together.

250
26:15.400 --> 26:16.720
Gather around.

251
26:18.280 --> 26:18.880
Take it.

252
26:20.840 --> 26:21.880
I’m so freaking cool.

253
26:35.040 --> 26:35.560
Hey.

254
26:37.080 --> 26:37.720
Where is Yong?

255
26:46.200 --> 26:46.760
Kradat.

256
26:48.120 --> 26:49.040
What happened to your wrist?

257
26:50.480 --> 26:54.160
I fell while I ran after the photo studio owner.

258
26:55.840 --> 26:56.600
I’m sorry.

259
26:57.600 --> 26:58.400
It’s my fault.

260
26:58.480 --> 27:00.240
It’s not a big deal.

261
27:01.240 --> 27:02.960
He probably ran away from a debt collector.

262
27:03.040 --> 27:05.800
We can ask the locals about your mom.

263
27:05.880 --> 27:07.440
I’m sure we will get some news about her.

264
27:16.360 --> 27:20.680
Do you know anyone who is well-connected in Thonburi?

265
27:21.560 --> 27:22.920
Well-connected?

266
27:24.320 --> 27:25.400
Hongsen Gaoyod.

267
27:27.560 --> 27:28.160
Who?

268
27:29.720 --> 27:31.480
Hongsen Gaoyod.

269
27:34.320 --> 27:35.000
Who?

270
27:40.920 --> 27:42.480
Hongsen Gaoyod.

271
27:44.400 --> 27:45.080
I see.

272
27:46.600 --> 27:47.800
Hongsen Gaoyod.

273
27:48.840 --> 27:49.400
Who?

274
27:51.040 --> 27:52.000
I’m kidding.

275
27:55.800 --> 27:56.480
Doesn’t it hurt?

276
28:01.440 --> 28:02.640
Hongsen Gaoyod?

277
28:06.400 --> 28:09.080
GAOYOD GANG, THONBURI PROVINCE (HONGSEN GARAGE)

278
28:09.080 --> 28:11.280
(HONGSEN GARAGE)

279
28:12.160 --> 28:13.120
Come on, Sen.

280
28:14.560 --> 28:15.480
He wants to leave our gang.

281
28:15.600 --> 28:16.480
You should have scolded him.

282
28:17.160 --> 28:18.320
Instead, you gave him money to start a new life.

283
28:19.000 --> 28:19.800
How are you going to feed our gang?

284
28:26.600 --> 28:27.040
Den.

285
28:34.240 --> 28:35.080
Can I borrow 20 baht?

286
28:35.480 --> 28:36.520
Damn, Sen.

287
28:37.400 --> 28:38.360
Why did you give him the money?

288
28:39.320 --> 28:41.680
If someone wants to leave our gang, you just let them go.

289
28:42.120 --> 28:43.880
We barely have anyone left in the gang.

290
28:51.440 --> 28:51.880
Aod.

291
28:52.800 --> 28:53.360
Thanks a lot.

292
28:55.000 --> 28:56.840
Why are you pushing the bike?

293
28:57.480 --> 28:58.520
They punctured the tires.

294
29:03.520 --> 29:04.560
Aren’t you going to do anything about it?

295
29:06.920 --> 29:07.360
Sen.

296
29:08.400 --> 29:09.800
Are you really going to retire from the game?

297
29:12.960 --> 29:13.400
Yes.

298
29:18.120 --> 29:19.280
Before I do that, I need to find out

299
29:20.520 --> 29:25.320
who the hell killed Suea Yai and framed me.

300
30:15.720 --> 30:16.400
Come on, Dad.

301
30:23.520 --> 30:24.280
Let’s celebrate.

302
30:34.200 --> 30:35.240
After the election,

303
30:37.880 --> 30:39.960
Boss Aang will give me the warehouse.

304
30:42.880 --> 30:44.880
I will have a business to take care of my subordinates.

305
30:46.080 --> 30:47.240
Just like you wanted.

306
30:49.920 --> 30:50.840
Are you happy?

307
30:53.120 --> 30:54.000
Come on, Dad.

308
30:55.080 --> 30:56.080
Let’s clink our glasses.

309
31:00.320 --> 31:01.520
Why don’t you drink it?

310
31:02.520 --> 31:03.880
It’s not fun to drink alone.

311
31:20.040 --> 31:20.920
Wait a little bit longer, Dad.

312
31:24.160 --> 31:24.880
No matter what,

313
31:26.880 --> 31:29.240
I will drag Hongsen here to apologize to you.

314
32:00.800 --> 32:01.320
Hey.

315
32:03.160 --> 32:03.680
That’s my drink.

316
32:04.000 --> 32:05.080
No, it’s my drink.

317
32:06.120 --> 32:07.360
This is my damn drink.

318
32:07.480 --> 32:08.400
You drank my drink.

319
32:08.840 --> 32:09.880
No, I didn’t.

320
32:10.320 --> 32:11.840
I saw you drink it.

321
32:12.080 --> 32:13.720
If you wanted to drink it, you could have just asked.

322
32:13.720 --> 32:14.840
I didn’t want your drink.

323
32:14.840 --> 32:16.440
This is my drink. I saw you drink it.

324
32:16.440 --> 32:17.280
I told you I didn’t drink it.

325
32:17.280 --> 32:17.800
I saw it.

326
32:17.800 --> 32:18.160
Hey!

327
32:19.240 --> 32:20.000
Other people are watching the movie.

328
32:20.520 --> 32:21.600
If you want to argue, go do it somewhere else.

329
32:33.400 --> 32:34.120
What color is your drink?

330
32:35.160 --> 32:35.680
Red.

331
32:36.120 --> 32:37.080
Look.

332
32:38.240 --> 32:38.680
What color is it?

333
32:42.320 --> 32:42.840
Is it clear?

334
32:44.760 --> 32:46.280
Can’t you tell the difference between red and green?

335
32:49.040 --> 32:49.680
Wait a sec.

336
32:50.040 --> 32:50.560
What?

337
32:55.400 --> 32:56.160
Can I have one green drink?

338
32:58.120 --> 32:59.080
He drank it all.

339
33:05.320 --> 33:06.440
Here. Are we cool now?

340
33:08.280 --> 33:08.680
No.

341
33:10.600 --> 33:12.760
Do you think you could buy me another one and it would be over?

342
33:14.520 --> 33:15.240
You won’t accept it, right?

343
33:15.280 --> 33:15.720
No.

344
33:17.920 --> 33:18.400
Fine.

345
33:30.280 --> 33:30.960
Are we done now?

346
33:33.240 --> 33:33.840
Do you know…

347
33:35.000 --> 33:35.440
who I am?

348
33:37.280 --> 33:39.600
Do you know who I am?

349
33:45.480 --> 33:47.400
I’m Zeng Klookfoon.

350
33:50.440 --> 33:51.000
I’m…

351
33:52.440 --> 33:53.520
Zoe Tawai Waen.

352
33:57.240 --> 33:57.920
What?

353
34:02.360 --> 34:03.120
Hey.

354
34:04.480 --> 34:05.200
What the hell are you doing?

355
34:06.120 --> 34:06.800
Let me go.

356
34:07.320 --> 34:08.200
This is my wallet.

357
34:09.320 --> 34:09.920
This is mine.

358
34:09.920 --> 34:10.560
It’s mine.

359
34:11.920 --> 34:12.440
You are a thief.

360
34:12.880 --> 34:14.320
You not only stole my drink but also my wallet.

361
34:14.800 --> 34:16.320
I didn’t steal your wallet. This is my wallet.

362
34:16.360 --> 34:18.280
You stole it. This is my wallet.

363
34:18.280 --> 34:19.160
It’s mine.

364
34:21.480 --> 34:23.400
What are you doing? Don’t touch my butt.

365
34:25.440 --> 34:26.040
What is this?

366
34:35.920 --> 34:36.480
Whose is this?

367
34:38.640 --> 34:39.120
I…

368
34:40.120 --> 34:40.960
Why didn’t you tell me earlier?

369
34:41.920 --> 34:42.600
What the heck?!

370
34:43.480 --> 34:44.600
Give my wallet back.

371
34:51.720 --> 34:53.440
Is there anything else you want from me?

372
34:53.800 --> 34:54.200
Huh?

373
34:57.480 --> 34:58.120
Zeng.

374
35:00.920 --> 35:01.600
I found Yong.

375
35:03.320 --> 35:03.960
Where is he?

376
36:06.160 --> 36:07.040
Are you Kradat’s father?

377
36:09.240 --> 36:09.640
Shh!

378
36:10.480 --> 36:11.320
Yes, I’m her dad.

379
36:11.640 --> 36:12.400
Who are you?

380
36:15.800 --> 36:16.960
Are you stealing her scissors?

381
36:17.680 --> 36:19.200
I’m just borrowing them.

382
36:20.720 --> 36:21.600
If you were my son,

383
36:22.320 --> 36:23.600
would you let your father die?

384
36:24.240 --> 36:25.200
You are overreacting.

385
36:25.840 --> 36:26.840
The country is governed by the rule of law.

386
36:28.360 --> 36:29.920
Do you know Hongsen Gaoyod?

387
36:31.960 --> 36:32.760
If you don’t know him,

388
36:33.320 --> 36:34.360
at least you must have heard about him.

389
36:35.240 --> 36:36.920
Go to the market and say his name.

390
36:37.520 --> 36:38.640
Even dogs are scared of him.

391
36:39.680 --> 36:41.760
Is he that scary?

392
36:42.440 --> 36:42.920
Yes.

393
36:43.520 --> 36:44.400
Wait.

394
36:44.640 --> 36:46.320
Kradat needs them to make a living.

395
37:05.120 --> 37:05.520
Den.

396
37:06.080 --> 37:06.960
Calm down.

397
37:07.360 --> 37:07.800
Hey.

398
37:08.800 --> 37:10.040
Are you trying to skip out on your debt?

399
37:10.240 --> 37:10.840
No, I’m not.

400
37:10.840 --> 37:12.800
I’m going to get money to pay you back.

401
37:13.200 --> 37:14.520
Den, I’ll go get it.

402
37:14.840 --> 37:16.040
It won’t take long.

403
37:16.120 --> 37:16.680
Hurry up.

404
37:17.280 --> 37:18.760
Yes, I will.

405
37:26.760 --> 37:27.440
Hongsen!

406
37:33.760 --> 37:35.160
Here. I have this.

407
37:35.480 --> 37:36.680
Take it.

408
37:36.960 --> 37:37.680
You can take it.

409
37:38.320 --> 37:38.720
Take it.

410
37:38.960 --> 37:39.400
Hey.

411
37:40.560 --> 37:41.320
That’s mine.

412
37:48.200 --> 37:51.440
I told you to use it to pay off your debt to Hongsen.

413
38:02.680 --> 38:03.480
You are Hongsen?

414
38:08.600 --> 38:09.120
Hey.

415
38:10.920 --> 38:11.440
Dad.

416
38:12.160 --> 38:12.680
Dad.

417
38:14.000 --> 38:15.240
Sen, please let my dad go.

418
38:15.560 --> 38:17.720
I’ll pay it back, no matter how much he owes you.

419
38:21.560 --> 38:22.320
Are you sure you want to do that?

420
38:22.800 --> 38:23.240
Yes.

421
38:25.400 --> 38:26.160
Let him go.

422
38:27.560 --> 38:28.240
Take this.

423
38:43.240 --> 38:43.840
It’s not enough.

424
38:45.720 --> 38:46.120
Huh?

425
38:47.480 --> 38:48.240
How much does he owe you?

426
38:51.160 --> 38:52.560
1,500 baht.

427
38:59.560 --> 39:00.040
Sen

428
39:00.640 --> 39:01.160
Sen.

429
39:02.240 --> 39:03.200
Klookfoon Gang is here.

430
39:04.880 --> 39:05.360
Zeng.

431
39:10.280 --> 39:10.760
Zeng.

432
39:12.520 --> 39:14.080
Everyone, pack up.

433
39:14.480 --> 39:16.600
Hurry up and pack everything up.

434
39:16.840 --> 39:17.840
What’s going on?

435
39:18.080 --> 39:20.320
The gangsters are going to fight here.

436
39:20.480 --> 39:21.600
Hurry up. They are here.

437
39:56.640 --> 39:57.000
Yong.

438
40:01.600 --> 40:03.360
Yong? You two know each other?

439
40:03.640 --> 40:04.320
Go take Yong here.

440
40:04.680 --> 40:05.120
Yong.

441
40:05.400 --> 40:05.840
Hey.

442
40:08.440 --> 40:09.680
I came here to take my man back.

443
40:10.200 --> 40:10.800
Don’t butt in.

444
40:13.200 --> 40:13.640
Butt in?

445
40:14.480 --> 40:15.440
This is my turf.

446
40:16.160 --> 40:18.160
Oh, this is your turf?

447
40:27.560 --> 40:28.040
So what?

448
40:31.040 --> 40:31.400
Move.

449
40:39.600 --> 40:40.680
If you can walk past me.

450
40:45.480 --> 40:46.960
Ever since you got out of prison,

451
40:48.640 --> 40:50.160
we haven’t had a chance to get together for a round.

452
41:01.440 --> 41:02.160
How about now?

453
41:03.360 --> 41:03.800
Hey.

454
41:04.320 --> 41:04.960
Don’t butt in.

455
41:08.560 --> 41:12.160
Don’t ever think that it is over just because you served your time in jail.

456
41:12.760 --> 41:14.120
It’s still not over for me.

457
41:15.200 --> 41:17.320
You need to pay me for killing my father.

458
41:19.200 --> 41:20.400
What nonsense are you rambling on?

459
41:21.280 --> 41:23.880
I’m asking you: do you want to do it now?

460
41:31.200 --> 41:31.840
Asshole!

461
41:40.640 --> 41:42.520
Let’s go, Kradat. Come on.

462
42:09.720 --> 42:10.120
You!

463
42:49.160 --> 42:53.360
Do you bastards ever go a day without making trouble?

464
42:54.400 --> 42:56.240
You brought your whole gang from Phra Nakorn

465
42:56.920 --> 42:58.320
and scared the hell out of everyone here.

466
43:01.120 --> 43:02.120
Arrest them all!

467
43:03.120 --> 43:03.960
Follow them.

468
43:19.400 --> 43:20.880
You think you can run away from me, Zeng?

469
43:21.560 --> 43:22.120
Stop it.

470
43:24.320 --> 43:24.720
Stop it.

471
43:27.080 --> 43:27.880
Zeng.

472
43:32.520 --> 43:33.840
It’s over, Zeng.

473
43:36.920 --> 43:37.920
Aren’t you tired, Inspector?

474
43:42.840 --> 43:43.240
Arrest him.

475
43:48.000 --> 43:48.400
Zeng.

476
43:51.160 --> 43:51.960
F*ck you, Zeng.

477
43:53.640 --> 43:55.200
Let's see how long you can stay under the water, Zeng.

478
44:01.080 --> 44:01.600
This way.

479
44:01.600 --> 44:02.920
Come on. Grab it.

480
44:02.920 --> 44:03.480
Climb up.

481
44:03.960 --> 44:04.440
This way.

482
44:07.680 --> 44:09.080
Grab it.

483
44:09.240 --> 44:10.160
Grab it.

484
44:11.960 --> 44:13.280
Yes, grab it like that.

485
44:14.960 --> 44:15.440
Move.

486
44:16.160 --> 44:16.760
Zeng.

487
44:18.000 --> 44:19.840
Please don’t shoot me.

488
44:20.560 --> 44:22.120
I’m not a gangster. I’m just a temple boy.

489
44:23.320 --> 44:23.880
Don’t shoot me.

490
44:28.200 --> 44:29.320
Damn it.

491
44:29.520 --> 44:31.240
Stop it.

492
44:36.040 --> 44:38.040
Hongsen, you make me run myself ragged.

493
44:38.600 --> 44:39.080
You!

494
44:45.640 --> 44:46.200
Hurry up.

495
44:48.240 --> 44:48.680
Come on.

496
44:53.160 --> 44:54.800
What the heck?

497
44:56.800 --> 44:57.360
Follow them.

498
45:04.080 --> 45:04.680
Hide here.

499
45:13.880 --> 45:16.240
I saw them go into that alley. Hurry, check it out!

500
45:24.560 --> 45:25.880
Hey. Do you see them?

501
45:26.440 --> 45:27.480
No one is there.

502
45:28.200 --> 45:28.800
Where did they go?

503
45:28.960 --> 45:30.160
I saw them running this way.

504
45:31.720 --> 45:32.920
It’s okay. Let’s keep looking for them.

505
45:33.320 --> 45:33.680
Go.

506
45:55.400 --> 45:55.840
Hey.

507
45:57.080 --> 45:57.560
Hey.

508
45:58.640 --> 45:59.120
Hey.

509
46:00.680 --> 46:01.160
Hey.

510
46:03.960 --> 46:04.560
Father.

511
46:07.480 --> 46:08.320
Where am I?

512
46:26.400 --> 46:27.600
You did mouth-to-mouth on me.

513
46:30.960 --> 46:32.720
I will never forget that you saved my life.

514
46:40.560 --> 46:42.080
I’m still alive because of you.

515
46:57.400 --> 46:57.760
You!

516
47:18.760 --> 47:20.120
So you are a temple boy.

517
47:24.520 --> 47:25.440
Stop it.

518
47:25.440 --> 47:26.200
Hey, stop it!

519
47:27.520 --> 47:28.200
What do you want?

520
47:30.880 --> 47:31.280
Nothing.

521
47:32.600 --> 47:33.280
It’s good that you live here.

522
47:34.200 --> 47:37.280
From now on, if Father needs anything,

523
47:38.120 --> 47:39.000
you need to tell me right away.

524
47:40.960 --> 47:41.280
Why?

525
47:42.000 --> 47:43.360
I will arrange it for him.

526
47:43.920 --> 47:45.120
He saved my life.

527
47:45.760 --> 47:47.000
I need to pay him back.

528
47:47.480 --> 47:48.960
He just helped you.

529
47:49.720 --> 47:50.920
He doesn’t expect anything in return.

530
47:52.280 --> 47:53.320
I have to pay him back.

531
47:53.920 --> 47:55.040
I don’t like owing anyone.

532
47:56.520 --> 47:59.280
You are a gangster.

533
47:59.600 --> 47:59.920
Yes.

534
48:00.920 --> 48:01.720
Now you know.

535
48:02.800 --> 48:04.160
Why did you ask so many questions?

536
48:04.680 --> 48:06.200
What if you owed me?

537
48:08.640 --> 48:10.120
Would you pay me back?

538
48:18.120 --> 48:20.200
Yes, but it’s unlikely.

539
48:21.160 --> 48:23.080
Because I…

540
48:27.080 --> 48:28.640
I will never need your help.

541
48:31.600 --> 48:32.560
Why are you laughing?

542
48:38.720 --> 48:41.640
If I help you by telling you what Father needs,

543
48:43.000 --> 48:45.040
does it mean you owe me?

544
48:48.160 --> 48:49.360
You are so tricky.

545
48:53.880 --> 48:54.480
I’ll hire you.

546
49:07.680 --> 49:08.600
You’re such a pain in the ass.

547
49:14.200 --> 49:14.640
Hey.

548
49:39.960 --> 49:40.760
What is going on?

549
49:43.440 --> 49:44.080
Father.

550
49:45.680 --> 49:46.920
Please take care of him.

551
50:00.480 --> 50:01.360
Is he crazy?

552
50:11.760 --> 50:12.520
You hate gangsters.

553
50:14.400 --> 50:15.480
But you helped me twice.

554
50:16.200 --> 50:16.560
Thank you.

555
50:19.760 --> 50:20.360
I…

556
50:20.400 --> 50:21.400
Do you really hate gangsters?

557
50:25.640 --> 50:26.240
I don’t like them.

558
50:27.480 --> 50:28.520
But it doesn’t mean I won’t befriend them.

559
50:29.320 --> 50:29.800
It depends on the person.

560
50:38.840 --> 50:40.040
Are you a part of Zeng Klookfoon’s gang?

561
50:42.640 --> 50:43.080
Yes.

562
50:44.400 --> 50:45.080
I had a problem with them.

563
50:45.920 --> 50:46.560
So I ran away.

564
50:50.280 --> 50:50.720
What was the problem?

565
50:53.320 --> 50:54.440
It was about work.

566
50:55.400 --> 50:57.160
Nothing I did was good enough for my bro...

567
50:58.200 --> 50:59.600
Nothing I did was good enough for Big Bro…

568
51:00.440 --> 51:02.280
Nothing I did was good enough for Zeng.

569
51:03.280 --> 51:04.400
So I just ran away.

570
51:06.760 --> 51:07.160
Hey.

571
51:08.640 --> 51:10.200
Aren’t you going to give me anything in return?

572
51:10.480 --> 51:11.320
I saved your life.

573
51:13.160 --> 51:14.400
I thought you were a good person.

574
51:15.320 --> 51:16.360
You wouldn’t want anything in return.

575
51:17.520 --> 51:18.600
On the bus, you told me

576
51:19.320 --> 51:20.680
you didn’t want to owe anyone.

577
51:22.200 --> 51:25.640
On the bus, you told me I needed to help myself first.

578
51:26.960 --> 51:27.360
Yes.

579
51:28.720 --> 51:29.520
That was then.

580
51:30.080 --> 51:31.760
But now, I want something in return.

581
51:32.320 --> 51:34.400
So you need to repay me.

582
51:39.080 --> 51:40.120
I want to join your gang.

583
51:44.520 --> 51:44.880
Huh?

584
51:48.920 --> 51:49.920
If I go back to Phra Nakorn,

585
51:50.920 --> 51:52.160
Zeng will beat me to death.

586
51:53.040 --> 51:54.240
I’ll be safe if I stay with you.

587
51:56.520 --> 51:57.400
I want to join your gang.

588
51:58.480 --> 51:59.240
I will work for you.

589
52:02.360 --> 52:04.160
Please let me join your gang, boss.

590
52:09.640 --> 52:10.240
Hey.

591
52:13.280 --> 52:14.560
You still owe me.

592
52:14.920 --> 52:15.560
You need to repay me.

593
52:17.160 --> 52:18.480
I don’t beat you up.

594
52:19.440 --> 52:21.000
That means I already repaid you.

595
52:23.400 --> 52:24.720
But I helped you twice.

596
52:26.880 --> 52:28.600
You repaid me by not beating me up for the first help.

597
52:29.080 --> 52:29.880
You still owe me.

598
52:30.840 --> 52:31.800
You have to accept me into your gang.

599
52:40.080 --> 52:40.920
Will you take me in or not?

600
53:08.400 --> 53:09.600
Hong, can I have two of my usual?

601
53:15.520 --> 53:16.240
What the hell are you looking at?

602
53:17.360 --> 53:18.200
You, motherf*cker.

603
53:18.720 --> 53:19.320
Motherf*cker.

604
53:19.480 --> 53:20.800
What the f*ck is your problem?

605
53:20.920 --> 53:21.960
Asshole.

606
53:21.960 --> 53:23.640
Do you want me to throw you out?

607
53:24.600 --> 53:25.040
Sit down.

608
53:31.960 --> 53:33.960
Hongsen Gaoyod is the real deal.

609
53:34.680 --> 53:36.280
Zeng Klookfoon is formidable.

610
53:38.000 --> 53:39.920
Hongsen Gaoyod is so talented.

611
53:40.800 --> 53:43.000
Zeng Klookfoon is so scary.

612
53:44.360 --> 53:45.720
Hongsen is so manly.

613
53:45.840 --> 53:47.760
Zeng is so handsome.

614
53:48.440 --> 53:48.800
Ptuh!

615
53:49.360 --> 53:50.360
What the hell?

616
53:50.360 --> 53:50.920
What?

617
53:50.920 --> 53:51.440
What?

618
53:51.520 --> 53:52.360
Why?

619
53:52.800 --> 53:54.200
Bring it on.

620
53:55.160 --> 53:56.480
My soy milk.

621
53:57.560 --> 53:58.560
Sit down separately.

622
53:59.000 --> 53:59.440
Go.

623
53:59.600 --> 54:00.320
Go away.

624
54:00.320 --> 54:00.800
Go away.

625
54:00.800 --> 54:01.280
Go.

626
54:02.760 --> 54:04.280
Hello. My name is Yong.

627
54:04.760 --> 54:06.600
I’m a new member of Gaoyod Gang.

628
54:07.880 --> 54:10.840
Is your gang so poor that you have to scare people to get a free meal?

629
54:11.560 --> 54:15.040
You have no right to huff and puff at my men.

630
54:15.720 --> 54:17.520
Aren’t there any temples in Phra Nakorn?

631
54:19.360 --> 54:20.840
My dad’s tomb is at this temple.

632
54:21.120 --> 54:23.040
Have you ever thought of apologizing to him?
